step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the simple mean of the full model pool to see if a robust baseline performs well.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to test if weighting improves over the simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it outperforms the weighted inverse-error mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming extremes improves over weighted and median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis by using ONLY_FT_catboost as the sole forecast to see if a single strong model beats the ensemble.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_FT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a robust DBA on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if iterative optimization beats the single best model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full model pool to see if a more sophisticated weighting improves over inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Evaluate a DBA on the full pool to see if full‑pool optimization outperforms the current best dba on pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean of the compact, stable pool1 to see if averaging only the top 5 models improves over the best weighted/full or dba pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination on the small, stable pool1 to see if weighting improves over the simple mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the small, stable pool1 to see if it outperforms the current mean pool1 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a simple mean on a different pool (pool2) to see if a slightly larger but still stable subset improves over mean pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

